{"title": "Celestial", "pageid": 14220, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Celestial", "categories": ["Creatures", "Races"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Deva_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Deva_Model.png/300px-Deva_Model.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Deva_Model.png/450px-Deva_Model.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Deva_Model.png/600px-Deva_Model.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Deva_Model.png/300px-Deva_Model.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"370\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Deva_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption><div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">  A typical celestial creature called a Deva.  </div></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Celestials</b> are a type of <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_creature_types\" title=\"List of creature types\">creature</a> that come from or are descended from creatures in the <a href=\"/wiki/Nine_Hells\" title=\"Nine Hells\">Upper Planes</a>. They are good-natured creatures, and are the counterpart of <a href=\"/wiki/Fiends\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fiends\">Fiends</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 100px; height: 100px; clip-path: xywh(0 0 100% 100% round 15%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Portrait_Deva.png/100px-Portrait_Deva.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Portrait_Deva.png/150px-Portrait_Deva.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/bd/Portrait_Deva.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Portrait_Deva.png/100px-Portrait_Deva.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/Portrait_Deva.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Good-aligned creatures native to the Upper Planes. Many of them are servants of deities, employed in the mortal realm.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— In-game racial description</div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characteristics\">Characteristics</span></h2>\n<p>Celestials come in a variety of forms and sizes and are united in their common cause to do good. Celestials are usually angelic in appearance and derive their power from the gods.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Types_of_celestials\">Types of celestials</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Hollyphant\">Hollyphant</span></h3>\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Main articles: <a href=\"/wiki/Hollyphant\" title=\"Hollyphant\">Hollyphant</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Hollyphant\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hollyphant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Hollyphant\">Hollyphant</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></div>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 100px; height: 100px; clip-path: xywh(0 0 100% 100% round 15%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hollyphant\" title=\"Hollyphant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png/100px-Portrait_Valeria.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png/150px-Portrait_Valeria.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png/100px-Portrait_Valeria.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Bobbing like corks in the earnest, busy muddle-puddle of their lives, hollyphants are sweet-natured little pachyderms who often serve as helpers to good-aligned deities.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— In-game racial description</div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<p>Hollyphant are winged miniature elephant-like creatures with golden fur.\n</p>\n<h4><span id=\"Hollyphants_in_Baldur.27s_Gate_3\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Hollyphants_in_Baldur's_Gate_3\">Hollyphants in Baldur's Gate 3</span></h4>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Valeria\" title=\"Valeria\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png/30px-Portrait_Valeria.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png/45px-Portrait_Valeria.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png/60px-Portrait_Valeria.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Valeria\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png/30px-Portrait_Valeria.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Valeria\" title=\"Valeria\">Valeria</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other\">Other</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deva\" title=\"Deva\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Portrait_Deva.png/30px-Portrait_Deva.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Portrait_Deva.png/45px-Portrait_Deva.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Portrait_Deva.png/60px-Portrait_Deva.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deva\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Portrait_Deva.png/30px-Portrait_Deva.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/Portrait_Deva.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deva\" title=\"Deva\">Deva</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonlight_Sliver\" title=\"Moonlight Sliver\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Moonlight_Sliver.png/30px-Portrait_Moonlight_Sliver.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Moonlight_Sliver.png/45px-Portrait_Moonlight_Sliver.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Moonlight_Sliver.png/60px-Portrait_Moonlight_Sliver.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Moonlight Sliver\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Moonlight_Sliver.png/30px-Portrait_Moonlight_Sliver.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Portrait_Moonlight_Sliver.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Moonlight_Sliver\" title=\"Moonlight Sliver\">Moonlight Sliver</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_spells_and_abilities\">Related spells and abilities</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Sense\" title=\"Divine Sense\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Divine_Sense_Icon.webp/30px-Divine_Sense_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Divine_Sense_Icon.webp/45px-Divine_Sense_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Divine_Sense_Icon.webp/60px-Divine_Sense_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Divine Sense\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Divine_Sense_Icon.webp/30px-Divine_Sense_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/41/Divine_Sense_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Sense\" title=\"Divine Sense\">Divine Sense</a></span> - grants advantage on attack rolls against celestials</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Planar_Binding\" title=\"Planar Binding\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Planar_Binding_Icon.webp/30px-Planar_Binding_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Planar_Binding_Icon.webp/45px-Planar_Binding_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Planar_Binding_Icon.webp/60px-Planar_Binding_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Planar Binding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Planar_Binding_Icon.webp/30px-Planar_Binding_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Planar_Binding_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Planar_Binding\" title=\"Planar Binding\">Planar Binding</a></span> - if successful, takes control of enemy celestial</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Protection_from_Evil_and_Good\" title=\"Protection from Evil and Good\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp/30px-Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp/45px-Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp/60px-Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Protection from Evil and Good\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp/30px-Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Protection_from_Evil_and_Good\" title=\"Protection from Evil and Good\">Protection from Evil and Good</a></span> - celestials have disadvantage against the target</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Celestial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Celestial\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Celestial\">Celestial</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r138587\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul ul{display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt,.mw-parser-output .hlist li,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd,.mw